-- l4 lint fixture: section 9 prevails over section 7 and nothing joins the two:
-- neither calls the other and no third decision calls both. A finding.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7 — extensions are barred` n MEANS
    n GREATER THAN 10

@ref Act s 9 — "Notwithstanding section 7, the Director may grant extensions."
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 9 — extensions may be granted` n MEANS
    n GREATER THAN 1
